<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7594] Tx performance drop after WAL optimization </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7594</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Perfomance dropes in tx-putAll benchmarks after commit with WAL optimization.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;WAL Mode: Default&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;First bad commit:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/a5ffd4eb18e6e9eab30c176a7bb4008a51b3d59d&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/a5ffd4eb18e6e9eab30c176a7bb4008a51b3d59d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
